fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"frei0r/frei0r-filter-gate-weave.html#frei0r-filter-gate-weave:interval","fragment":"\n\tinterval\n\nThe amount of time before the position is randomized again. The larger the number the slower the picture will move.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t0.6\n\n"});